                  "timeFrame": "Change from baseline to 6 weeks"
                },
                {
                  "measure": "Change in Spirometry parameters at 6 weeks",
                  "description": "Change in: Forced expiratory volume in 1 second (FEV1); forced vital capacity (FVC); forced expriatory flow between 25-75% of vital capacity; FEV1/FVC ratio.",
                  "timeFrame": "Change from baseline to 6 weeks"
                },
